<title>SWEDEN: RALLYING-LEADING PLACINGS IN SWEDISH RALLY AFTER THIRD DAY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-LEADING PLACINGS IN SWEDISH RALLY AFTER THIRD DAY.</headline>
<dateline>KARLSTAD, Sweden 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>Swedish Rally after 18 stages on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford  two hours 59 minutes and 54</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p>2. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru 3:00:06</p>
<p>3. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru 3:00:21</p>
<p>4. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi 3:00.48</p>
<p>5. Tomas Radstrom (Sweden) Toyota 3:01:57</p>
<p>6. Armin Schwarz (Germany) Ford 3:02:57</p>
<p>7. Mats Jansson (Sweden) Toyota  3:03:09</p>
<p>8. Marcus Gronholm (Finland) Toyota 3:03:31</p>
<p>9. Mats Jonsson (Sweden) Ford 3:04:01</p>
<p>10. Stig Blomqvist (Sweden) Ford 3:05:07</p>
